## A. Floats page: Figure 2 + the glossary only

§4 currently mixes body text, the Glossary quote block
(`main.tex:372–388`, "\textbf{Glossary.} Parametric memory …"), and
Figure 2 (`\begin{figure}` at `:466`, no placement specifier). The author
wants Figure 2 AND the glossary on their own dedicated **floats page**
(nothing else on it).
- Implement as a `[p]` float page carrying both: make Figure 2 a `[p]`
  float and place the glossary on the same page (e.g. the glossary as a
  boxed float / `\begin{figure}[p]` companion or a minipage on the float
